            },
            "text_cFyaLk": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Left untreated? Yes, but luckily that doesn't need to be the case for most feet. </p><p>Wearing  shoes with a narrow, tapered toebox, your big toe will continue to be push inward and therefore pushing out the first metatarsal. This is the footwear problem, not a foot problem.</p><p>When we work to get your bones back into proper alignment, using our toe spacers and a wide toe-box shoe, you will begin to notice less pain as it slowly strengthens over time.</p>",
